openBDK — NOTICE
================

openBDK is the open Blockchain/Bridge Deployment Kit. Author: Professor Codephreak.

LICENSING (per component)
-------------------------
- Smart contracts & SDK code in this `openbdk/` tree, and the DeltaVerse
  `neuralnode/` contracts:                          MIT  (Professor Codephreak).
  The bridge trio inherits canonical patterns from Polygon Labs' Stake-the-Bridge
  / usdc-lxly work (also MIT/Apache lineage).
- Alpine-Linux-based BDK INFRASTRUCTURE components (the Kurtosis-CDK devnet
  orchestration at github.com/lair3 — bdk5/bdk6, NOT vendored here): GPL, per
